  "title": "Electrical Interlock Now IEC Modular-Compatible",
  "summary": "The nVent HOFFMAN IEC Electrical Interlock is equipped with a newly designed mounting bracket to support the IEC Modular Enclosure platform. The core functionality of the interlock remains untouched. When energized, the electrical interlock provides a positive internal safety lockout that prevents the door from being opened.",
